# Secrets never enter the repo.
#
# The RAW ARCHIVE (data/raw) left git on 2026-09-07: 287MB in 11,936 files
# across 31 day folders, growing weekly -- the shape that forced the store
# out at 88MB. It lives as release assets, one tar per day folder
# (tools/raw_state.py); its provenance is the committed data/raw.json
# sidecar, which must NEVER be ignored. History before that date still
# carries the files.
#
# The STORE (data/parl-monitor.db) is different as of 2026-08-24: it reached
# 92MB against GitHub's 100MB hard push limit, growing ~15MB per build
# sprint, so it moved to a GitHub Release asset (tools/db_state.py). Its
# provenance lives on as the committed data/parl-monitor.db.json sidecar
# (size + sha256 + producing run), which is why that file must NEVER be
# ignored.
#
# Phase 2 done 2026-08-24: the first asset was published by Senedd weekly
# run 32721990336, so the store itself is now ignored. A workflow gets it
# from the release (tools/db_state.py --pull), which fails LOUDLY rather
# than building an empty store if the asset is ever missing.
data/parl-monitor.db
config/secrets.yaml
data/pull-logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
partner_site/.vercel/
partner_site/.env.local
.vercel
.env*
# Google service account key: never commit
config/google-service-account.json
data/.store-pulled
data/raw/
data/.raw-pulled
# Debate pack footage: large, licensed, local
data/packs/*/clips/
